<title>Nigeria: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/nigeria/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-nigeria-2026-11-21T19:35:09.017Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:35:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed herders attacked communities and a military base in Benue State, while gunmen in military uniforms killed three and injured 13 in Gombe. Gunmen disguised as soldiers ambushed a university guard in Plateau, killing him, and later killed another guard returning home with his wife; a herder was also shot dead in the same state. A machete attack wounded former footballer Segun Odegbami at his Abeokuta home. Rev. Ezekiel Dachomo mourned residents and a soldier killed in the latest Plateau attack. The conflict recorded 1,486 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxQLXlmV3FaaVp6dXBGU1ZPTlNSQ1BxUUdzYVcwdUJ6cGNaTDJ0aW1Ea2x4U01qYVVRbmJBcUJubUhkS1NBdGgtdmlLYkduN2s5X3dmNlVpeDJRamNtT0VQazlDZFFjRXZlTE1sbGRfNEw3bHk3aWx3dERNdEtXd2FSdWhYM0tHSzMzS0J6T3FYa0VWT19aMHk2eUFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQRkh4aVZCWHM2Vi1pT1o2RUpiUGVGUG0tTW1UcDZSVGtyQ2s3ckJRSWxRdVVrT3hRM1BZUlpXdUZYWUE2RzlXUTk3S3ZHUklKVVFKMXF1aDNsU3Q1Z0Y0cFJmd3NvT0lOOEZ1b0s3eTUyTnVEdEx6RlRCN3U1OEdxSVozWkJtQnhsQV9OUjVMNVJ1eXNYY3d3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiogFBVV95cUxOdWpNaTdZQm1nMVZkMkRnMHJRRk1qTVdDckpDXzJKMDBaWkdseFV5bkhMTEdyOWFId0l1UXdxUVhLdF9CZUt3VG5WQkdvWHFLaUItcE5rSDNxdGZfbEhqUFdsU0NnT3VsaldZWjlxTnpRV1pZbFl4bFVpZzB6QWczQmlhS0R0NTZld1Bvb3NtMmVoZFFmajJLb09uNnY2bDVPbFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPR0J2RUp3N2JfOEFtMFV6Q3NYdlpCeUk4eURkT1Q2YmVMUGs1bl8xcEhRSEduRWthVF9UbHZDNG53eG1CUjdzMEZTU09yQWlBYnRORHBxYlNvNnM4Unp1UU9EU21TRDZ5Vjh3YUw3UWEwR0x0WTdiRVhaTnpBQlN1bkotV25MdHNMT0w1SEZ2QTkwX2tHUHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google